8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람한테","audio":"/audio/cfa9073a06cf6c466b47.mp3"}},{"text":"서슴없이","meaning":"毫不犹豫地，毫不迟疑地","explanation":"서슴없이：毫不犹豫地，毫不迟疑地。","readings":[{"term":"서슴없이","audio":"/audio/c6c5e970387776133866.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62703","senseId":"1","lemma":"서슴없이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"서슴없이","audio":"/audio/c6c5e970387776133866.mp3"}},{"text":"대할","meaning":"相待","explanation":"대하다：相待；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"대하다","audio":"/audio/4033b88da1605ad4f103.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86300","senseId":"2","lemma":"대하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대할","audio":"/audio/bcd63ef0421ea2972584.mp3"}},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}},{"text":"있어?","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어","audio":"/audio/675a95c70a831521b983.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"52024d86ccae834b","term":"어쩌면","zh":"怎么","audio":"/audio/52024d86ccae834bc671.mp3","entryId":"67121","definition":"到底为什么。","pronunciation":["어쩌면"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"91390eadfad43d09","term":"처음","zh":"第一次，初次","audio":"/audio/913